# Shell scripts need LF unconditionally - a CRLF shebang line
# (`#!/bin/sh` followed by \r\n) fails to execute on Linux, which is exactly
# where these run (Docker image builds, CI). Without this, a checkout on
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true would silently convert them to CRLF and
# break every Docker build from that point on.
*.sh text eol=lf
